      <h1 class="page-title max-w-3xl">Hospitality</h1>
      <p>Hotels and hospitality groups across the MEA region are elevating guest experiences through connected technology — from seamless Wi-Fi to integrated surveillance and IPTV. MEAICON delivers the network and security infrastructure that powers modern hospitality.</p>
